      "heading": "What is a quadratic equation?",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "A quadratic equation has an x squared term.",
          "write": "x² + 2x − 15 = 0"
        },
        {
          "say": "Standard form has everything on one side, equal to 0.",
          "write": "ax² + bx + c = 0"
        },
        {
          "say": "It can have two, one or no solutions. We also call them roots.",
          "write": "solutions = roots"
